Template: homelab-roundcube/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host to bootstrap the split runtime/migrate roles on:
 Used once, at install time, to create the narrow homelab_roundcube_runtime/
 homelab_roundcube_migrate role pair and its own "roundcube" schema (see
 CLAUDE.md's split-role design). Needs direct Postgres access (peer auth
 as the postgres OS user, locally or over SSH) — this is NOT the host
 Roundcube connects to at runtime, see pgbouncer_host below.

Template: homelab-roundcube/pgbouncer_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PgBouncer host for Roundcube's own runtime database connection:
 Roundcube's db_dsnw connects here at runtime (port 6432), never straight
 to Postgres — see CLAUDE.md's split runtime/migrate role design. The
 bootstrapped runtime role is also registered into this host's pgbouncer
 userlist.txt.

Template: homelab-roundcube/internal_port
Type: string
Default: 8080
Description: Internal loopback port for Roundcube's own nginx+PHP-FPM vhost:
 homelab-webproxy's own sites.yml reverse-proxies to this port — must
 match whatever "upstream: 127.0.0.1:<port>" is configured there for
 Roundcube's domain.

Template: homelab-roundcube/product_name
Type: string
Default: Homelab Webmail
Description: Product name shown on the login screen and window title:
